OL,3,CFrance and Spain battle raging
OL,4,Cwildfires as another 55,000 flee homes
OL,6,FA raging wildfire in southwest France
OL,7,Fhas forced the overnight evacuation of
OL,8,Fa further 55,000 people from six towns.
OL,10,FFlames crept ever closer to the wine
OL,11,Fregion city of Bordeaux, in the
OL,12,FGironde region.
OL,14,FFires have raged across Europe over
OL,15,Fthe past week with more than 330,000
OL,16,Fforced to flee their homes.
OL,18,FBefore Sunday, around 220,000 had been
OL,19,Fdisplaced in France.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
