OL,3,CFrance and Spain battle raging
OL,4,Cwildfires as another 55,000 flee homes
OL,6,FNeighboring Spain oversaw its own
OL,7,Fevacuation of 73,000 on the country's
OL,8,Feast coast. One man died in Manises, a
OL,9,Fsuburb of Valencia, the country's
OL,10,Ffirst recorded death in the latest
OL,11,Ffires.
OL,13,FFrench authorities - where Bordeaux is
OL,14,Flocated - said gusting winds and arid
OL,15,Fconditions complicated the massive
OL,16,Feffort to limit the wildfire's spread.
OL,18,FInterior minister Laurent Nunez
OL,19,Fexplained that after a "difficult"
OL,20,Fnight for fire crews, "the situation
OL,21,Fremains very unfavourable".
OL,26,@{D@XOU{D@bO]|D@WOU}D@ZO]
