OL,3,CFrance and Spain battle raging
OL,4,Cwildfires as another 55,000 flee homes
OL,6,FPresident Emmanuel Macron said France
OL,7,Fwould "rebuild" and his government
OL,8,Fwill be there "for as long as is
OL,9,Fneeded".
OL,11,FMacron asked Prime Minister Sebastien
OL,12,FLecornu to activate the government's
OL,13,Fcrisis response unit and instructed
OL,14,Fthe armed forces to mobilise.
OL,16,FIn the southwest of his nation,
OL,17,Fgusting winds fed the flames
OL,18,Fovernight, accelerating the spread of
OL,19,Fthe monster blaze that has burned out
OL,20,Fof control since midweek.
