OL,3,CFrance and Spain battle raging
OL,4,Cwildfires as another 55,000 flee homes
OL,6,F"The fire again became extremely
OL,7,Fvirulent again and unpredictable,
OL,8,Fgenerating its own winds and advancing
OL,9,Ferratically toward the Bordeaux
OL,10,Fmetropolitan area," Nunez posted on X.
OL,12,F"It became calmer by the end of the
OL,13,Fnight," he added.
OL,15,FMuch of the burning 162 square miles
OL,16,Fof tinder-dry pine forests and
OL,17,Fscrubland have been made worse by
OL,18,Fsuccessive heatwaves this year.
