OL,3,CFrance and Spain battle raging
OL,4,Cwildfires as another 55,000 flee homes
OL,6,FThe area is seven times the size of
OL,7,FManhattan island and four times bigger
OL,8,Fthan French capital Paris.
OL,10,FFirefighters are battling to slow the
OL,11,Fflames' progression toward Bordeaux,
OL,12,Fboth on the ground and in the air,
OL,13,Fwith planes dropping water and
OL,14,Fretardants.
OL,16,FSoldiers have been called in to
OL,17,Freinforce fire crews' exhausting round-
OL,18,Fthe-clock efforts.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
