OL,3,CFrance and Spain battle raging
OL,4,Cwildfires as another 55,000 flee homes
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FBordeaux Mayor Thomas Cazenave
OL,12,Fdescribed the fire as being "at the
OL,13,Fgates of the metropolitan area",
OL,14,Fhaving advanced to about nine miles
OL,15,Ffrom the city at its closest point.
OL,17,FAuthorities ordered the partial
OL,18,Fclosure of a major highway heading in
OL,19,Fand out of the city.
