OL,3,CFrance and Spain battle raging
OL,4,Cwildfires as another 55,000 flee homes
OL,6,FIn Spain, a new round of evacuations
OL,7,Fdue to wildfires took place in the
OL,8,FValencia, Madrid Avila and Toledo
OL,9,Fareas.
OL,11,FEarlier this month, 13 people were
OL,12,Fkilled in a fire in southern Spain,
OL,13,Fthe country's deadliest blaze in
OL,14,Frecent memory.
